      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Every time I think this country is too woke, I look at what's going on in Britain, and it puts it in perspective. #RTOvertime\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2052444212789117271",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T17:43:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": ".@DrDebraSoh this week at @ClubRandom_!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2051302483780374764",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T14:06:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I don't need to chase every one of your manufactured buzzwords down the rabbit hole.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2050413159949672872",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T03:12:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I am not surprised the attempt failed, because take it from a comedian, no one ever kills at the White House Correspondents' Dinner.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2050412898149700090",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T03:11:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Somehow, the ultra-rich keep getting ultra-richer, while a growing percentage of people feel truly desperate.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2047876753062756796",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-25T03:14:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "What\u2019s the status of the War with Iran?  We\u2019re seizing their boats, they\u2019re seizing our boats. It\u2019s less like a Holy War and more like a Florida divorce.\n\nVideo",
